# tally 2.2.1 P37, Q6 (L §5.18's diff row): a line whose expression names a thing the base doesn't declare
# is added, per tuple of its binding: qb (a def only sc declares) and qpb (a place only sc declares) (review
# g2 min/b5 with sc/b5). Before W8: changed against the base's hole, and 0.00 PLN.
=== b5.tally
model b5
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  opening[konto] = 500.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"
ask kk: bal(konto, 2026-03-31)
=== b5.tally
scenario sc over b5
  tally 2
  from 2026-01-01
place pot: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
input sx: money PLN
def extra: money PLN
  rule base = sx
version scv
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  sx = 1.00 PLN "s"
version scv2
  cite s
  governs 2026-01-01..
  known 2026-01-01
  opening[pot] = 7.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"
ask qd: diff(extra) in sc against b5
ask qp: diff(bal(pot, 2026-03-31)) in sc against b5
ask qb: diff(extra * k for k in [1, 2]) in sc against b5
ask qpb: diff(bal(pot, d) for d in [2026-03-31]) in sc against b5
=== expect qd qp qb qpb
qd: diff in sc against b5: 0 changed, 1 added, 0 removed, 0 unchanged
  added extra: 1.00 PLN
  world: b5
  world: sc
  cut 2026-01-01
qp: diff in sc against b5: 0 changed, 1 added, 0 removed, 0 unchanged
  added bal(pot, 2026-03-31): 7.00 PLN
  world: b5
  world: sc
  cut 2026-01-01
qb: diff in sc against b5: 0 changed, 2 added, 0 removed, 0 unchanged
  added (k = 1): 1.00 PLN
  added (k = 2): 2.00 PLN
  world: b5
  world: sc
  cut 2026-01-01
qpb: diff in sc against b5: 0 changed, 1 added, 0 removed, 0 unchanged
  added (d = 2026-03-31): 7.00 PLN
  world: b5
  world: sc
  cut 2026-01-01
warning: WARN-UNREAD place world is read by nothing
